; Status line text: 32 characters
;
; Printed on row 19 of the screen by #R$88AE when a room is entered. Columns
; 0-15 "Items collected ", 16-18 the item count digits (printed over each frame
; from #R$857C by #R$89AD at $5070), column 19 a blank, 20-23 "Time", 24 a
; blank, 25-30 the clock (printed over each frame from #R$857F at $5079) and
; column 31 "m", which completes "am" or "pm" after the clock letter. The
; "00:00" and the three zeros here are placeholders that are never seen.
@label=StatusLineText
t$8554 DEFM "Items collected 000 Time 00:00 m"
